    "title": "Man accused of assault in convent - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Mark Ellebracht ,\n11 hours ago A Godfrey man is charged after he allegedly walked into an Alton religious convent and assaulted one of the residents. 22-year-old Logan Strack is charged with aggravated battery and criminal sexual abuse following the incident Saturday night at the Sisters of St. Francis Convent. He is being held pending a court hearing. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 10",
